      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.11.2</h3>
<p>The switch for command suggestions had no name on it.</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>Settings ▸ Terminal showed a checkbox with nothing written beside it.</b>
      It turns command suggestions on and off, and nothing on screen said so.
      If you wanted to turn suggestions off, there was no way to know that was
      the switch. It now reads <b>Suggest commands as I type</b>.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
